Port 22
AddressFamily inet
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd no
PermitUserEnvironment yes
# The provider's public key is a read-only bind mount owned by the host uid, so
# it never matches `garm`; StrictModes off keeps sshd from rejecting it. This is
# a throwaway fake host, not a hardened endpoint.
StrictModes no
